  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe makes 24"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gyoza"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and takes about 55 minutes total."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The folding takes practice. Your first few will be uneven. By the end of the batch they will look much better. All of them will taste good."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The steam-fry method is what makes gyoza work. You fry the bottoms first to get colour, then add water and cover the pan to steam the tops. Finally you uncover to let the water evaporate, which crisps the base back up. Do not skip any of these stages."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
